1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,291
Clips taking hours after your stream?

2
00:00:03,241 --> 00:00:04,445
That's the VOD queue.

3
00:00:04,445 --> 00:00:07,081
Clipping only starts after you end the stream.

4
00:00:08,031 --> 00:00:12,810
ClipMe's engine can clip during the stream itself, so clips land while it's still going.

5
00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:16,213
Paste a VOD free at clipme.com.

